title: Sensitive Directory Archived for Exfiltration
id: 9d82bad5-77e1-4f18-ac65-d34daa3f7598
status: experimental
description: Detects creation of a compressed archive over sensitive directories (tar of /etc, /home, /root, or database data dirs), a staging step before exfiltration on Linux.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1560/001/
logsource:
  product: linux
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith: '/tar'
    CommandLine|contains:
      - '/etc'
      - '/home'
      - '/root'
      - '/var/lib/mysql'
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'czf'
      - 'cjf'
      - '-c'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - User
  - Image
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate backups
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.collection
  - attack.t1560.001
